# Google Maps Lead Finder - Environment Configuration

## 🎯 DATA SOURCE SELECTION (Choose your provider)

### Option 1: Google Places API (Best quality, paid after $300 free)
- Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
- Enable: Places API, Maps JavaScript API
- Cost: ~$0.017 per 1000 requests (first $300 free credit)
- Credit card required (for identity verification only)

```env
DATA_SOURCE=google
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```

### Option 2: Yelp Fusion API (Completely FREE, 5,000 calls/day)
- Get from: https://www.yelp.com/developers/v3/manage_app
- Sign up free (email only, NO credit card)
- Cost: FREE forever (5,000 calls/day)
- Best for: US businesses, restaurants, shops, services

```env
DATA_SOURCE=yelp
YELP_API_KEY=your_yelp_api_key_here
```

### Option 3: OpenStreetMap (Completely FREE, unlimited)
- No API key needed!
- Community-maintained data
- Lower quality: may miss phone/website
- Best for: Global locations, basic business info

```env
DATA_SOURCE=openstreetmap
# No API key needed
```

### Option 4: Multiple sources (merge results)
```env
DATA_SOURCE=all
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_key_here
YELP_API_KEY=your_yelp_key_here
# Combines results from all configured sources
```

## Quick Recommendation
**No credit card?** Use `DATA_SOURCE=yelp` (free API key) or `DATA_SOURCE=openstreetmap` (no key needed).

**Want best data?** Use `DATA_SOURCE=google` (get $300 free trial).

# ==========================================
# GENERAL CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================
# Data source: google, yelp, openstreetmap, or all
DATA_SOURCE=openstreetmap

# ==========================================
# DATA SOURCE: GOOGLE PLACES (BEST DATA)
# ==========================================
# Requires: Credit card for identity verification (won't be charged unless exceed $300)
# Cost: First $300 free (90 days), then ~$0.017 per 1000 searches
# Best for: Comprehensive data, phone, website, ratings, reviews, opening hours

GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Optional: Google Sheets Export
# Enable Google Sheets API in same project
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY=path/to/service-account-key.json
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=your_sheet_id

GOOGLE_PLACES_BASE=https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/place

# ==========================================
# DATA SOURCE: YELP (FREE, NO CREDIT CARD)
# ==========================================
# Sign up: https://www.yelp.com/developers/v3/manage_app
# Cost: FREE - 5,000 calls/day (no credit card!)
# Data: Name, address, phone, ratings, reviews, photos
# Note: Provides Yelp page URL, not business website

YELP_API_KEY=

# ==========================================
# DATA SOURCE: OPENSTREEMAP (COMPLETely FREE)
# ==========================================
# No API key needed! 100% free, unlimited
# Data: Name, address, coordinates, amenity type
# Limited: Usually no phone/website/ratings

OVERPASS_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter

# ==========================================
# SEARCH SETTINGS (Common)
# ==========================================
# Maximum results per query (1-200, depends on source limits)
MAX_RESULTS_PER_QUERY=100

# Delay between requests in milliseconds (avoid rate limiting)
REQUEST_DELAY=200

# Concurrent searches (1-20, be respectful)
CONCURRENT_SEARCHES=5

# Max retries for failed requests
MAX_RETRIES=3

# Default location if not specified
DEFAULT_LOCATION=New York, NY

# Search radius in meters (1-50000)
SEARCH_RADIUS=5000

# ==========================================
# PROXY SETTINGS (Optional)
# ==========================================
#HTTP_PROXY=http://proxy1:3128
#HTTPS_PROXY=https://proxy1:3128
#PROXY_FILE=./config/proxies.txt
#ROTATE_PROXIES=false

# ==========================================
# DATABASE
# ==========================================
DATABASE_PATH=./data/leads.db
#DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/leads
DEDUP_ENABLED=true
DEDUP_FIELDS=name,address

# ==========================================
# EXPORT SETTINGS
# ==========================================
DEFAULT_EXPORT_FORMAT=csv
EXPORT_PATH=./exports
SCRAPE_WEBSITES=true
EXTRACT_EMAILS=true
EXTRACT_SOCIAL=true
SCREENSHOT_WEBSITES=false
INCLUDE_PHOTOS=false
PHOTO_MAX_WIDTH=800

# ==========================================
# LEAD SCORING
# ==========================================
MIN_RATING=3.0
MIN_REVIEWS=10
SCORE_WEBSITE=10
SCORE_EMAIL=15
SCORE_PHONE=10

# ==========================================
# WEB DASHBOARD
# ==========================================
ENABLE_DASHBOARD=false
DASHBOARD_PORT=3000
#DASHBOARD_USER=admin
#DASHBOARD_PASS=your-secure-password
DASHBOARD_SSL=false
SSL_KEY_PATH=
SSL_CERT_PATH=

# ==========================================
# NOTIFICATIONS (Optional)
# ==========================================
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=recipient@example.com

WEBHOOK_URL=
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=

# ==========================================
# LOGGING
# ==========================================
LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_FILE=./logs/lead-finder.log
MAX_LOG_FILES=7
LOG_ROTATION=daily

# ==========================================
# LEGAL & COMPLIANCE
# ==========================================
RESPECT_ROBOTSTXT=true
USER_AGENT=LeadFinderBot/1.0 (contact: your-email.com)
AUTO_GDPR_REMOVAL=false
DATA_RETENTION_DAYS=365
